    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">As a greeting, a sign of intimidation or courtship, you flaunt your crest and your feathers, prominently displaying them. When you use this action in a social context, you can either Make an Impression or Coerce a creature immediately rather than needing to converse for 1 minute. In other contexts, including combat, you can make a Request or a Demoralize attempt with a +1 circumstance bonus. If you were to become a Master in the respective skill, you increase the corresponding attempt’s bonus to a +2.</span></p>",
